OL,5,G1900 Inside the Ambulance
OL,6,     FThe West Midlands Ambulance
OL,7,     Fparamedics answer the call of more
OL,8,     Fpeople in need. Hannah and Amy
OL,9,     Ftreat a teenager whose pain has
OL,10,     Fleft her unable to speak.
OL,11,G2000 Inside the Operating Theatre
OL,12,     FDr Fox is in the visitors' room
OL,13,     Ffor a change when his fiancee
OL,14,     FSally has an operation to remove
OL,15,     Fher wisdom teeth. Another patient
OL,16,     Fhas surgery to have a double
OL,17,     Fhernia repaired.
